M8.0: VPM shear gated to additive draws only + vpm reg
 bounds guard

M7.3 made the shear engage on EVERY shader carrying ViewProjectionMatrix
once the metadata caps fell - including main-view shaders that sample the
mono reflection texture (their reflection uvs went wrong in both eyes).
The measured artifact class is additive (killmask: ab=1 dst=ONE), so the
shear now applies there and nowhere else. The combat crash class is closed
by refusing vrVpmReg > 220 (4-row matrix off the end of the constant file).

